@baseUrl = http://localhost:8014

### 접속 확인: 200, name/version/help 객체
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/about

### API 도움말: 200, 요청 안내 6개 배열
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/help

### 상태 조회: 200, light/fan/environment/revision/log
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/state

### 모의 온도 설정: 200, environment.temperature=29
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/environment
Content-Type: application/json

{"temperature": 29}

### 팬 작동: 200, fan.on=true (온도 자동 하강 없음)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/fan
Content-Type: application/json

{"on": true}

### 변경 후 상태 재조회: 200, light/fan/environment/revision/log
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/state
